{"metadata":{"description":"Session Workbench for DeepSeek Harness: session-library full-text search + recall + conversation-view management (show/hide + reorder). 会话工作台：会话库（历史会话全文搜索与召回）+ 会话视图（标签栏显示/隐藏 + 拖拽排序）。","id":"gh:1341458981","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-session-workbench","slug":"PolinniZhong/dsh-session-workbench","topics":["conversation-view","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","knowledge-base","recall","session-search","session-workbench","show-hide","tab-management","view-hide","view-management","view-reorder"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Session Workbench for DeepSeek Harness: session-library full-text search + recall + conversation-vie"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"w management (show/hide + reorder). 会话工作台：会话库（历史会话全文搜索与召回）+ 会话视图（标签栏显示/隐藏 + 拖拽排序）。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-session-workbench — Session Workbench for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Search every past session and recall the ones you need as `@references`; manage the conversation-v"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"iew tab bar (show/hide + reorder). One plugin, three entry points."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 中文 · Privacy · Docs"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it is"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness ships with a full-text search engine (SQLite FTS5) and cross-session references (`@"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"session mention`), but neither has a user-facing interface. This plugin adds the missing **discover "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"→ browse → insert** layer:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Search** — full-text search across all your past sessions (all workspaces), with workspace / tim"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"e-range / archive filters, and cursor pagination;
- **Fragment hits (v1.1)** — results are per-sessi"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"on best-hit **fragment cards**: the matched sentence highlighted with its surrounding context (lazy-"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"loaded), so you see *the sentence*, not just *which session*;
- **Same-session hits (v1.2)** — expan"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"ding a fragment card shows a "More hits in this session" fold with the other matches (first 5, then "},{"id":"p7s6","text":"load more), each highlighted — no more hunting for the rest of a session's matches;
- **Locate (v1.1"},{"id":"p7s7","text":", composite anchors in v1.2)** — click **Locate** on a fragment card to open that session, page the "},{"id":"p7s8","text":"window back, and scroll to the exact message with a flash highlight; v1.2 matches the hit sentence *"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"plus* its preceding text so repeated wording lands on the right occurrence; when unmatched, a non-bl"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"ocking toast tells you to scroll manually;
- **Recall** — pick up to 3 sessions and insert them into"},{"id":"p7s11","text":" the input as reference chips in one click; on send, the platform injects read-only snapshots (`## R"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"eferenced sessions`) and the AI answers with your historical context;
- **Recent** — a minimal recen"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"t-sessions list so you can find things fast without searching;
- **Archives** — search includes **ar"},{"id":"p7s14","text":"chived sessions by default** (with an "Archived" badge and all / active-only / archived-only filters"},{"id":"p7s15","text":") — after DSH archives a session it's visible nowhere else, so search is the only way back; the Rece"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"nt list excludes archived sessions by default;
- **Settings** — enable/disable switch + default sear"},{"id":"p7s17","text":"ch scope + privacy statement;
- **Conversation views (new in 1.0.0)** — manage the session tab bar: "},{"id":"p7s18","text":"**show/hide** each custom view and **reorder** them by drag-and-drop, from both the *会话工作台 settings "},{"id":"p7s19","text":"entry (会话视图 partition)* and a *right-click / double-click panel* on the tab bar itself."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Fragment search (v1.1)** — searching "Vibe Coding" returns per-session fragment cards: matched sen"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"tence highlighted, context below:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Locate (v1.1)** — the session opens and scrolls to the exact hit message with a flash highlight:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Pick & insert** — check up to 3 sessions, insert them into the input as reference chips:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Settings** — enable/disable card with expandable options and privacy statement:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Videos"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Conversation views — reorder in Settings** (drag the ⋮⋮ handle):"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Conversation views — reorder from the tab-bar panel** (right-click / double-click a tab):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"> High-res `.mp4` versions live in docs/videos/."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) with a **web** profile — the plugin is a static bundle (its client is ser"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ved at runtime; a page refresh picks up client changes, host/profile changes need a restart).
- For "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"session-library search, a **persistent FTS index** must be enabled in the web profile (`openAt: star"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"rch, a **persistent FTS index** must be enabled in the web profile (`openAt: startup`), see Install."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"> Local development can also use a `link:` dependency (same pattern as dsh-personal-center)."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Enable full-text search (required):** the web profile disables the FTS index by default (`openAt: "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"never`). Override it in `<DSH_HOME>/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` — use a **persistent** index path"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" and `openAt: startup` so the index is built once on launch and reused (a `:memory:` index would reb"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"uild on every search and block the host):"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"> ⚠️ `path` must be an **absolute path** — the platform resolves it with `path.resolve` and does **n"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ot** expand `~` or environment variables. Writing `~/.dsh/...` silently creates the index inside the"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" DSH dependency tree (lost on upgrade, and a large un-checkpointed WAL makes searches take minutes)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Then **restart the DSH app** (host-side config and route changes require a restart; client-bundle ch"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"anges only need a page refresh)."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"1. Open the **Session KB** tab in the right sidebar (better-sidebar); the Settings → Session KB sect"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ion can disable/enable it;
2. Without a keyword you see **Recent sessions**; click the search icon ("},{"id":"p28s3","text":"top-right) to expand the input, type a keyword (literal phrase match, e.g. `MCP config`) to switch t"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"o search results;
3. Click the **more** button (⋯) to filter by workspace / time range / archive (al"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"l incl. archived / active only / archived only);
4. Click a result to expand the preview (hit contex"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"t + session meta); click **Locate** to open that session and scroll to the exact hit message (flash-"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"highlighted); click the path to expand the full path; then check it (up to 3);
[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Platform limitations"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- At most **3** referenced sessions per message; **64 KB** snapshot budget per session (preview show"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"s a hint when a session is large);
- Search is **literal phrase matching** (FTS limitation) — no syn"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"onyms or semantics; quotes, `OR`, `*` are treated as plain characters;
- Only user/assistant text an"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"d some structured events are indexed — no reasoning, stream chunks, or headers;
- Archive semantics:"},{"id":"p30s5","text":" search includes archived sessions by default; the Recent list excludes them;
- **Locate is best-eff"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"ort**: the platform exposes no "open session at seq" API, so Locate pages the window back and text-m"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"atches the hit message — repeated text may land on an earlier occurrence, and hits beyond ~500 messa"},{"id":"p30s8","text":"ges back fall back to a manual-scroll toast."}],"truncated":true}
